# BrandBridge MVP — Complete Implementation Plan (v2)

> [!NOTE]
> **Changes from v1:**
> 1. **Email-only** — All OTP, notifications, reminders, and document delivery via email (Resend). No Twilio/SMS/WhatsApp for MVP.
> 2. **Agency flow** — Agency as middleman creating TWO separate contracts (Brand↔Agency + Agency↔Creator) with liability separation.

