## 5. Contract Lifecycle — State Machine

The state machine is **identical** for all four contract types. Only the labels change (who is "initiator" and who is "respondent").

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT: Initiator fills form

    DRAFT --> PENDING_RESPONDENT: Initiator submits<br/>(link generated, 7-day expiry set,<br/>email sent to respondent)
    DRAFT --> CANCELLED: Initiator cancels

    PENDING_RESPONDENT --> PENDING_INITIATOR: Respondent fills fields<br/>+ email OTP verifies<br/>+ signs first
    PENDING_RESPONDENT --> EXPIRED: 7 days pass<br/>(day-5 reminder email sent)
    PENDING_RESPONDENT --> CANCELLED: Initiator cancels

    PENDING_INITIATOR --> ACTIVE: Initiator reviews<br/>+ signs second<br/>(PDF generated + emailed to BOTH)

    ACTIVE --> COMPLETED: Both mark deal as fulfilled

    EXPIRED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    COMPLETED --> [*]
```

### Who is Initiator / Respondent in Each Scenario?

| Contract Type | Initiator (creates + signs last) | Respondent (receives link + signs first) |
|---|---|---|
| `CREATOR_TO_BRAND` | Creator | Brand |
| `BRAND_TO_CREATOR` | Brand | Creator |
| `AGENCY_TO_BRAND` | Agency | Brand |
| `AGENCY_TO_CREATOR` | Agency | Creator |

### Status Transitions & Triggers

| From | To | Trigger | Side Effects |
|---|---|---|---|
| — | `DRAFT` | Initiator opens contract form | — |
| `DRAFT` | `PENDING_RESPONDENT` | Initiator submits | Generate share link, set `expires_at` = now + 7 days, schedule day-5 reminder, **email link to respondent** |
| `PENDING_RESPONDENT` | `PENDING_INITIATOR` | Respondent fills + OTP verifies + signs | Store signature + metadata, **email notification to initiator** |
| `PENDING_RESPONDENT` | `EXPIRED` | Cron job detects `expires_at` passed | **Email expiry notice to initiator** |
| `PENDING_INITIATOR` | `ACTIVE` | Initiator signs | Store signature, generate PDF, compute SHA-256, lock document, **email signed PDF to BOTH parties as attachment** |
| `ACTIVE` | `COMPLETED` | Either party marks complete | Log audit event |
| Any pre-active | `CANCELLED` | Initiator cancels | **Email cancellation notice to respondent** (if link was sent) |

