| **Contract link sent** | Respondent | "You've received a contract from [Initiator]. Click to review and sign." + link | — |
| **Respondent signed** | Initiator | "[Respondent] has signed. Review and sign to activate the contract." + link | — |
| **Contract activated** (both signed) | Both parties | "Your contract #BB-2026-XXXX is now active. Signed document attached." | ✅ **Signed PDF** |
| **Day-5 reminder** | Respondent | "Reminder: Your contract from [Initiator] expires in 2 days. Sign now." + link | — |
| **Contract expired** | Initiator | "Contract #BB-2026-XXXX expired. [Respondent] did not sign within 7 days." | — |
| **Contract cancelled** | Respondent (if link was sent) | "[Initiator] has cancelled the contract." | — |
| **Advance received** | Both parties | "[Creator/Agency] confirmed receipt of advance payment." | — |

### Email Templates (Resend + React Email)

```typescript
// lib/notifications/email.ts
import { Resend } from 'resend';

const resend = new Resend(process.env.RESEND_API_KEY);

async function sendContractEmail(params: {
  to: string;
  subject: string;
  template: 'contract_link' | 'signed_notification' | 'contract_active' | 'reminder' | 'expired';
  data: Record<string, string>;
  pdfBuffer?: Buffer;  // For contract_active email
}) {
  const attachments = params.pdfBuffer
    ? [{ filename: `contract-${params.data.contractNumber}.pdf`, content: params.pdfBuffer }]
    : undefined;

  await resend.emails.send({
    from: 'BrandBridge <contracts@brandbridge.pk>',
    to: params.to,
    subject: params.subject,
    react: renderEmailTemplate(params.template, params.data),
    attachments,
  });
}
```

### Cron Jobs (Vercel Cron)

```json
// vercel.json
{
  "crons": [
    {
      "path": "/api/cron/check-expiry",
      "schedule": "0 * * * *"
    },
    {
      "path": "/api/cron/send-reminders",
      "schedule": "0 9 * * *"
    }
  ]
}
```

> [!TIP]
> **Why email-only is smart for MVP:**
> - Zero cost (Resend free tier: 100 emails/day = ~3,000/month)
> - No Twilio account, no WhatsApp Business verification, no per-SMS costs
> - Email is universal — every user has one
> - PDF attachment delivery is built-in with email APIs
> - WhatsApp/SMS can be added later as a growth feature once traction is proven

