## 15. Cost Estimates (MVP Phase)

| Service | Free Tier | When You'd Pay |
|---|---|---|
| **Vercel** | 100GB bandwidth, serverless functions | > limits ($20/mo) |
| **Supabase** | 500MB DB, 1GB storage, 50K MAU | > limits ($25/mo Pro) |
| **Resend** | 100 emails/day, 3,000/month | > 100/day ($20/mo) |
| **Domain** | — | ~$12/year |
| **Total MVP cost** | **~$1/month** (domain only) | Scales with usage |

> [!TIP]
> By going email-only, the MVP runs on **essentially $0/month** (all free tiers). No Twilio SMS costs, no WhatsApp Business API fees. This is a massive simplification.

