## 16. Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| **Supabase free tier pause** (1 week inactivity) | App goes down | Keep-alive cron ping; upgrade to Pro ($25/mo) when real users exist |
| **Resend daily limit** (100/day) | Can't send OTPs or notifications | Upgrade to paid ($20/mo) when volume grows |
| **Puppeteer on Vercel** (serverless limits) | PDF generation times out | Use `@sparticuz/chromium`; fallback: move PDF gen to Railway |
| **Email OTP deliverability** | OTP emails land in spam | Use custom domain for Resend, set up DKIM/SPF/DMARC |
| **CNIC collection scares users** | Low signup conversion | Optional at signup, mandatory only for contracts > PKR 50K |
| **Respondent never signs** | Contract stuck | 7-day expiry + day-5 reminder |
| **Agency creates mismatched contracts** | Brand-Agency ≠ Agency-Creator terms | Linked contract display shows both; BrandBridge doesn't enforce match (that's agency's responsibility) |
| **Legal challenge to e-signatures** | Contract validity questioned | ToS + lawyer review before launch; cite ETO 2002 |

